---
// Block displayed at the end of articles to encourage social follows
---

<aside class="follow-block" aria-labelledby="follow-title">
	<h3 id="follow-title" class="follow-title">Suivez Robot Éducatif</h3>
	<p class="follow-text">
		Rejoignez notre communauté pour découvrir nos derniers tutoriels, projets et guides d'achat robots éducatifs&nbsp;!
	</p>
	<div class="follow-links">
		<a 
			href="https://youtube.com/@roboteducatif6268" 
			target="_blank" 
			rel="noopener noreferrer"
			class="follow-link follow-link--youtube"
			aria-label="Suivez-nous sur YouTube"
		>
			<svg class="follow-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
				<path d="M23.498 6.186a3.016 3.016 0 0 0-2.122-2.136C19.505 3.545 12 3.545 12 3.545s-7.505 0-9.377.505A3.017 3.017 0 0 0 .502 6.186C0 8.07 0 12 0 12s0 3.93.502 5.814a3.016 3.016 0 0 0 2.122 2.136c1.871.505 9.376.505 9.376.505s7.505 0 9.377-.505a3.015 3.015 0 0 0 2.122-2.136C24 15.93 24 12 24 12s0-3.93-.502-5.814zM9.545 15.568V8.432L15.818 12l-6.273 3.568z"/>
			</svg>
			<span class="follow-label">YouTube</span>
		</a>
		<a 
			href="https://www.pinterest.fr/roboteducatif/" 
			target="_blank" 
			rel="noopener noreferrer"
			class="follow-link follow-link--pinterest"
			aria-label="Suivez-nous sur Pinterest"
		>
			<svg class="follow-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
				<path d="M12 0C5.373 0 0 5.372 0 12c0 5.084 3.163 9.426 7.627 11.174-.105-.949-.2-2.405.042-3.441.218-.937 1.407-5.965 1.407-5.965s-.359-.719-.359-1.782c0-1.668.967-2.914 2.171-2.914 1.023 0 1.518.769 1.518 1.69 0 1.029-.655 2.568-.994 3.995-.283 1.194.599 2.169 1.777 2.169 2.133 0 3.772-2.249 3.772-5.495 0-2.873-2.064-4.882-5.012-4.882-3.414 0-5.418 2.561-5.418 5.207 0 1.031.397 2.138.893 2.738.098.119.112.224.083.345l-.333 1.36c-.053.22-.174.267-.402.161-1.499-.698-2.436-2.889-2.436-4.649 0-3.785 2.75-7.262 7.929-7.262 4.163 0 7.398 2.967 7.398 6.931 0 4.136-2.607 7.464-6.227 7.464-1.216 0-2.359-.631-2.75-1.378l-.748 2.853c-.271 1.043-1.002 2.35-1.492 3.146C9.57 23.812 10.763 24 12 24c6.627 0 12-5.373 12-12 0-6.628-5.373-12-12-12z"/>
			</svg>
			<span class="follow-label">Pinterest</span>
		</a>
		<a 
			href="https://www.facebook.com/roboteducatif.info" 
			target="_blank" 
			rel="noopener noreferrer"
			class="follow-link follow-link--facebook"
			aria-label="Suivez-nous sur Facebook"
		>
			<svg class="follow-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
				<path d="M24 12.073c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12s-12 5.373-12 12c0 5.99 4.388 10.954 10.125 11.854v-8.385H7.078v-3.47h3.047V9.43c0-3.007 1.792-4.669 4.533-4.669 1.312 0 2.686.235 2.686.235v2.953H15.83c-1.491 0-1.956.925-1.956 1.874v2.25h3.328l-.532 3.47h-2.796v8.385C19.612 23.027 24 18.062 24 12.073z"/>
			</svg>
			<span class="follow-label">Facebook</span>
		</a>
	</div>
</aside>

<style>
	.follow-block {
		margin: 3rem 0 2rem;
		padding: 2rem;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, 
			color-mix(in oklab, var(--accent) 8%, var(--surface-2)) 0%, 
			var(--surface-2) 100%
		);
		border: 2px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--accent) 25%, var(--surface-border));
		border-radius: 12px;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.follow-title {
		margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
		font-size: 1.35rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		color: rgb(var(--black));
		font-family: var(--font-heading, system-ui);
	}

	.follow-text {
		margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		line-height: 1.5;
		color: rgb(var(--gray-dark));
		max-width: 600px;
		margin-left: auto;
		margin-right: auto;
	}

	.follow-links {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	.follow-link {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		border-radius: 8px;
		transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
		color: white;
	}

	.follow-icon {
		width: 20px;
		height: 20px;
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}

	.follow-link:hover {
		transform: translateY(-2px);
	}

	.follow-link--youtube {
		background: #FF0000;
		box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.3);
	}

	.follow-link--youtube:hover {
		background: #CC0000;
		box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.4);
	}

	.follow-link--pinterest {
		background: #E60023;
		box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(230, 0, 35, 0.3);
	}

	.follow-link--pinterest:hover {
		background: #AD081B;
		box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(230, 0, 35, 0.4);
	}

	.follow-link--facebook {
		background: #1877F2;
		box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(24, 119, 242, 0.3);
	}

	.follow-link--facebook:hover {
		background: #0C63D4;
		box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(24, 119, 242, 0.4);
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.follow-block {
			padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
			margin: 2rem 0 1.5rem;
		}

		.follow-title {
			font-size: 1.15rem;
		}

		.follow-text {
			font-size: 0.88rem;
			margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
		}

		.follow-links {
			gap: 0.75rem;
		}

		.follow-link {
			padding: 0.65rem 1rem;
			font-size: 0.88rem;
		}

		.follow-icon {
			width: 18px;
			height: 18px;
		}
	}
</style>
